{"page":566,"width":1735,"height":2541,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"14.4 일당 방법","words":[{"text":"14.4","x":1221,"y":155,"width":72,"height":22},{"text":"일당","x":1310,"y":154,"width":46,"height":26},{"text":"방법","x":1364,"y":155,"width":45,"height":25}]},{"text":"629","words":[{"text":"629","x":1480,"y":151,"width":57,"height":28}]},{"text":"포인터는 파일 공간의 훨씬 적은 비율을 사용한다. 이 방법을 사용하면 논리적-물리적","words":[{"text":"포인터는","x":303,"y":277,"width":129,"height":35},{"text":"파일","x":446,"y":278,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"공간의","x":521,"y":278,"width":87,"height":36},{"text":"훨씬","x":626,"y":279,"width":56,"height":34},{"text":"적은","x":699,"y":280,"width":56,"height":34},{"text":"비율을","x":770,"y":280,"width":86,"height":35},{"text":"사용한다.","x":870,"y":279,"width":131,"height":36},{"text":"이","x":1019,"y":279,"width":26,"height":35},{"text":"방법을","x":1064,"y":278,"width":95,"height":36},{"text":"사용하면","x":1173,"y":279,"width":128,"height":36},{"text":"논리적-물리적","x":1316,"y":278,"width":217,"height":38}]},{"text":"블록 매핑을 간단하게 유지할 수 있지만 디스크 헤드 탐색이 줄어들기 때문에 HDD 처","words":[{"text":"블록","x":303,"y":336,"width":64,"height":34},{"text":"매핑을","x":382,"y":336,"width":94,"height":35},{"text":"간단하게","x":489,"y":336,"width":118,"height":37},{"text":"유지할","x":622,"y":338,"width":88,"height":34},{"text":"수","x":721,"y":338,"width":30,"height":35},{"text":"있지만","x":764,"y":338,"width":87,"height":36},{"text":"디스크","x":865,"y":338,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"헤드","x":970,"y":337,"width":61,"height":36},{"text":"탐색이","x":1045,"y":337,"width":91,"height":36},{"text":"줄어들기","x":1152,"y":338,"width":125,"height":36},{"text":"때문에","x":1296,"y":338,"width":93,"height":35},{"text":"HDD","x":1404,"y":341,"width":87,"height":29},{"text":"처","x":1507,"y":340,"width":26,"height":35}]},{"text":"리량이 향상되고 블록 할당 및 가용 리스트 관리에 필요한 공간이 줄어든다. 블록이 부","words":[{"text":"리량이","x":306,"y":394,"width":90,"height":36},{"text":"향상되고","x":414,"y":394,"width":124,"height":35},{"text":"블록","x":552,"y":396,"width":