text":"table,","x":1181,"y":1113,"width":85,"height":34},{"text":"FAT)을","x":1281,"y":1110,"width":114,"height":39},{"text":"사용하는","x":1409,"y":1110,"width":128,"height":36}]},{"text":"것이다. 단순하지만 효율적인 이 방법은 MS-DOS 운영체제에서 시용된다. 각 파티션의","words":[{"text":"것이다.","x":304,"y":1167,"width":103,"height":36},{"text":"단순하지만","x":421,"y":1168,"width":158,"height":37},{"text":"효율적인","x":590,"y":1169,"width":121,"height":35},{"text":"이","x":726,"y":1170,"width":25,"height":35},{"text":"방법은","x":766,"y":1170,"width":92,"height":35},{"text":"MS-DOS","x":869,"y":1173,"width":136,"height":29},{"text":"운영체제에서","x":1017,"y":1170,"width":184,"height":37},{"text":"시용된다.","x":1216,"y":1171,"width":134,"height":36},{"text":"각","x":1365,"y":1170,"width":34,"height":36},{"text":"파티션의","x":1410,"y":1170,"width":124,"height":37}]},{"text":"시작 부분이 FAT로 사용된다. 이 FAT 테이블은 각 블록마다 한 개의 항목-을 가지고 있","words":[{"text":"시작","x":303,"y":1227,"width":65,"height":36},{"text":"부분이","x":381,"y":1228,"width":91,"height":36},{"text":"FAT로","x":488,"y":1232,"width":96,"height":28},{"text":"사용된다.","x":596,"y":1229,"width":128,"height":35},{"text":"이","x":741,"y":1229,"width":24,"height":36},{"text":"FAT","x":781,"y":1233,"width":63,"height":28},{"text":"테이블은","x":857,"y":1231,"width":123,"height":35},{"text":"각","x":992,"y":1230,"width":31,"height":35},{"text":"블록마다","x":1034,"y":1231,"width":125,"height":35},{"text":"한","x":1171,"y":1231,"width":32,"height":34},{"text":"개의","x":1215,"y":1231,"width":58,"height":36},{"text":"항목-을","x":1289,"y":1231,"width":97,"height":36},{"text":"가지고","x":1398,"y":1231,"width":95,"height":35},{"text":"있","x":1508,"y":1232,"width":28,"height":35}]},{"text":"고 이 항목은 디스크 블록 번호를 인덱스로 찾는다. 디렉터리의 항목은 각 파일의 첫 번","words":[{"text":"고","x":302,"y":1291,"width":34,"height":24},{"text":"이","x":350,"y":1287,"width":27,"height":35},{"text":"항목은","x":394,"y":1288,"width":97,"height":35},{"text":"디스크","x":504,"y":1288,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"블록","x":607,"y":1289,"width":62,"height":34